WEBVTT

00:07:58.716 --> 00:08:02.636
Despair and denial might appear
to exist on polar ends

00:08:02.676 --> 00:08:04.836
of the generational spectrum,

00:08:04.876 --> 00:08:08.356
yet they stem from the same place.

00:08:08.396 --> 00:08:10.756
How powerless we feel.

00:08:11.276 --> 00:08:12.436
All of us.

00:08:13.876 --> 00:08:17.076
I believe that the threat,
even greater than climate change,

00:08:17.116 --> 00:08:20.476
is how powerless we feel
in the face of it,

00:08:20.516 --> 00:08:22.596
concerned moms and dads,

00:08:22.636 --> 00:08:25.076
cautious corporate leaders,

00:08:25.076 --> 00:08:27.076
anxious 11-year-olds.

00:08:27.956 --> 00:08:31.356
And I don't believe
we will solve this crisis